From: Androlinzberg <host@androlinzberg.local>
Subject: [PATCH] wm: route AMS process helpers through the host authority

Pinned AMS owns zygote processes and cannot be imported into the hosted
process supervisor. Retain WM call order and policy through the tested host
permission, creator-token and scheduler boundary. Stock WM keeps task state.

